# OpenBar — Windsurf Rules

Read `.agents/AGENTS.md` and `.agents/knowledge/` for full project context before generating code.

## Quick Reference

**Stack**: Spring Boot 4.0.6 · Java 22 (pinned) · Angular 20 · Ionic 8.8.11 · NgRx 20 (auth only)

**Critical rules**:
- Backend: constructor injection only, Java record DTOs, `@Transactional` on writes, `@PreAuthorize` on write endpoints
- Frontend: Ionic components only (Angular Material ABANDONED), standalone components, lazy loading, Transloco for all text
- Tests: `frontend/src/test/` (mirror structure), `data-testid` on all interactive elements
- Java: JDK 22 exactly — Lombok 1.18.34 breaks silently on JDK 23+

